@startuml
autonumber
actor "User" as A
participant "System" as S

A -> S : filterAircraft(altitudeBand, emergencyOnly, withRouteOnly, keywords)
activate S
S --> A : shows the live aircraft matching every filter, and how many out of the total
deactivate S
loop every live update
  S --> A : applies the same filters to the new state
end
@enduml
